WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.250 --> 00:00:04.200
- I feel like I'm a little kid.

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:07.712
But I'm not, I'm an adult
woman and I can do this.

00:00:07.712 --> 00:00:10.530
(upbeat piano)

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:12.296
My name is Emily, I'm new to BuzzFeed,

00:00:12.296 --> 00:00:14.420
and I really want to
make some new friends.

00:00:14.420 --> 00:00:17.040
So to do that I've decided
to challenge myself

00:00:17.040 --> 00:00:20.520
to sit with strangers every
day during lunch this week.

00:00:20.520 --> 00:00:23.960
I'm equal parts excited
and a bit terrified.

00:00:23.960 --> 00:00:25.840
It may seem easy to some people

00:00:25.840 --> 00:00:27.857
but for me personally,
talking to new people

00:00:27.857 --> 00:00:29.777
is really difficult.

00:00:29.777 --> 00:00:32.360
Even though I knew people were probably

00:00:32.360 --> 00:00:36.600
going to be nice to me, I
was still a sweaty mess.

00:00:36.600 --> 00:00:37.720
It's gonna be fine.

00:00:37.720 --> 00:00:39.470
It's gonna be really good, alright.

00:00:42.060 --> 00:00:44.833
I'm gonna ask these cute boys

00:00:44.833 --> 00:00:47.642
if they don't mind me joining them.

00:00:47.642 --> 00:00:49.420
One second.

00:00:49.420 --> 00:00:50.830
Do you mind if I join you?

00:00:50.830 --> 00:00:51.708
Is that okay?

00:00:51.708 --> 00:00:53.120
Awesome, what's your name?

00:00:53.120 --> 00:00:54.160
- I'm Lewis.

00:00:54.160 --> 00:00:55.523
- Lewis, nice to meet you.

00:00:56.481 --> 00:00:57.481
- We've met.

00:01:00.210 --> 00:01:01.550
- [Lewis] What's the premise of this?

00:01:01.550 --> 00:01:03.217
- Premise is that I have difficulty

00:01:03.217 --> 00:01:05.360
making new friends a bit.

00:01:05.360 --> 00:01:06.671
- [Lewis] Do you have
friends just in real life?

00:01:06.671 --> 00:01:07.560
- Yes.

00:01:07.560 --> 00:01:08.680
- [Lewis] So the problem isn't with you.

00:01:08.680 --> 00:01:12.020
- The prob, it might be with
like my first impression.

00:01:12.020 --> 00:01:13.530
Like right now I'm sweating a lot.

00:01:13.530 --> 00:01:14.464
- [Lewis] How do you think
you're doing right now?

00:01:14.464 --> 00:01:16.050
- Right now I'm like
scared because you're like

00:01:16.050 --> 00:01:17.584
very pretty and very good at eye contact.

00:01:17.584 --> 00:01:19.910
- [Lewis] Oh stop.

00:01:19.910 --> 00:01:21.550
- And like, I already
messed up 'cause I like

00:01:21.550 --> 00:01:23.229
forgot that I met you, and I'm sorry.

00:01:23.229 --> 00:01:24.325
- No no, it's okay.

00:01:24.325 --> 00:01:26.613
I had a different haircut,
I wasn't wearing a beanie.

00:01:26.613 --> 00:01:29.470
- Thank you for taking the
time to talk to me, thank you.

00:01:29.470 --> 00:01:30.993
So that went pretty well.

00:01:36.060 --> 00:01:38.600
I see two people but
they're like in conversation

00:01:38.600 --> 00:01:39.610
and I don't want to interrupt,

00:01:39.610 --> 00:01:40.975
so just like hang back for a second.

00:01:40.975 --> 00:01:43.240
And I'm gonna go approach.

00:01:43.240 --> 00:01:44.520
Okay, bye.

00:01:44.520 --> 00:01:46.710
- Hey guys, I'm filming a video

00:01:46.710 --> 00:01:49.280
where I hang out in
the canteen with people

00:01:49.280 --> 00:01:51.060
I don't know during lunchtime.

00:01:51.060 --> 00:01:51.910
- Okay.

00:01:51.910 --> 00:01:53.676
- Can I hang out with
you for a little bit?

00:01:53.676 --> 00:01:54.550
- [Both] Sure.

00:01:54.550 --> 00:01:57.515
- I'm Emily. So nice to meet you.

00:01:57.515 --> 00:01:58.977
What do you guys do at BuzzFeed?

00:01:58.977 --> 00:02:00.410
- I'm a podcast host.

00:02:00.410 --> 00:02:01.243
- That's really cool.
- Have you heard of

00:02:01.243 --> 00:02:02.110
See Something Say Something?

00:02:02.110 --> 00:02:03.308
- Wait, oh my gosh, that's you?

00:02:03.308 --> 00:02:05.570
(laughing)

00:02:05.570 --> 00:02:06.850
sorry, I've only heard your
voice, I haven't seen your face.

00:02:06.850 --> 00:02:08.648
- That's me.

00:02:08.648 --> 00:02:10.308
- So like, working at
BuzzFeed, like everyone's

00:02:10.308 --> 00:02:12.287
really diverse and cool, and like

00:02:12.287 --> 00:02:13.680
part of the reason for doing this video

00:02:13.680 --> 00:02:16.490
is like selfishly I
want to talk to everyone

00:02:16.490 --> 00:02:18.370
and this like gives me
an excuse to be like hey,

00:02:18.370 --> 00:02:20.990
can I bombard your totally
personal conversation

00:02:20.990 --> 00:02:22.645
and just be like hi, I'm Emily.

00:02:22.645 --> 00:02:25.480
I'm Emily, do you guys mind
if I eat lunch with you today?

00:02:25.480 --> 00:02:27.432
- [Woman] Yeah, we mind.

00:02:27.432 --> 00:02:28.599
No, it's okay.

00:02:29.820 --> 00:02:34.413
- Hey, oh.

00:02:34.413 --> 00:02:35.300
Hey.
- Hey.

00:02:35.300 --> 00:02:37.110
- Do you guys mind if I
join you for a little bit?

00:02:37.110 --> 00:02:38.210
- Oh yeah, no worries.

00:02:40.070 --> 00:02:41.717
- Hey, is it alright if I join you?

00:02:41.717 --> 00:02:42.570
- Yeah.
- Go for it.

00:02:42.570 --> 00:02:43.477
- Yay.

00:02:43.477 --> 00:02:44.564
- We were just talking about The Bachelor.

00:02:44.564 --> 00:02:45.397
- Oh my gosh.

00:02:45.397 --> 00:02:46.655
So what are your opinions on The Bachelor?

00:02:46.655 --> 00:02:47.717
What are your lives like?

00:02:47.717 --> 00:02:48.706
What are you up to?

00:02:48.706 --> 00:02:49.906
- [Blonde Woman] Oh my gosh,
what are our lives like.

00:02:49.906 --> 00:02:50.739
- Wow what are our lives like.

00:02:50.739 --> 00:02:52.410
- Is that a good small talk?

00:02:52.410 --> 00:02:54.300
Once we got the ball
rolling small talk turned

00:02:54.300 --> 00:02:56.390
into regular conversation.

00:02:56.390 --> 00:02:58.070
It started to relax more.

00:02:58.070 --> 00:03:00.340
I talked about everything with everyone

00:03:00.340 --> 00:03:01.220
from buying homes,

00:03:01.220 --> 00:03:02.990
did you just buy a property?

00:03:02.990 --> 00:03:03.830
- I did, yeah.

00:03:03.830 --> 00:03:04.669
- [Emily] That's badass.

00:03:04.669 --> 00:03:06.339
To our favorite podcasts.

00:03:06.339 --> 00:03:08.779
- To like Radiolab, to This American Life,

00:03:08.779 --> 00:03:09.977
to My Favorite Murder.

00:03:09.977 --> 00:03:11.499
- I love My Favorite Murder.

00:03:11.499 --> 00:03:12.420
- So good.

00:03:12.420 --> 00:03:15.670
- [Emily] Or even how your
pets sexuality is a bit creepy.

00:03:15.670 --> 00:03:16.870
- Well I took away her sex organs, so.

00:03:16.870 --> 00:03:19.953
I took them away and I said,
you don't know what this is.

00:03:21.680 --> 00:03:22.950
You'll never know.

00:03:22.950 --> 00:03:24.203
- Why did you choose us?

00:03:24.203 --> 00:03:26.193
- Because I've wanted to talk to you.

00:03:27.540 --> 00:03:28.430
(laughter)

00:03:28.430 --> 00:03:29.263
Thank you.

00:03:29.263 --> 00:03:31.857
Yeah I was like too
nervous to eat, it's fine.

00:03:31.857 --> 00:03:33.233
Have a good day.

00:03:34.217 --> 00:03:36.600
(fanfare)

00:03:36.600 --> 00:03:39.090
it's really hard to eat in
front of people you don't know.

00:03:39.090 --> 00:03:40.876
Things I've found out this week.

00:03:40.876 --> 00:03:43.540
Let's eat lunch when
it's not being filmed.

00:03:43.540 --> 00:03:44.839
If you want, yeah, real cool.

00:03:44.839 --> 00:03:45.672
Hey Aaron.

00:03:45.672 --> 00:03:46.690
- This girl's really cool,

00:03:46.690 --> 00:03:48.600
this lunch was a great experience.

00:03:48.600 --> 00:03:51.610
- Oh no, thanks, bye.

00:03:51.610 --> 00:03:53.728
I finally ate in front of people

00:03:53.728 --> 00:03:56.240
so I'm excited about that.

00:03:56.240 --> 00:03:58.200
I still have a lot of sandwich left

00:03:58.200 --> 00:04:01.333
but you know, I'll go find a corner.

00:04:03.810 --> 00:04:06.220
I felt really proud of
myself for doing this.

00:04:06.220 --> 00:04:09.330
I was nervous every time
I approached a new table

00:04:09.330 --> 00:04:10.670
but I still did it.

00:04:10.670 --> 00:04:12.880
The connections I made
doing this were genuine.

00:04:12.880 --> 00:04:15.600
Afterwords, people came up to
me and still wanted to talk

00:04:15.600 --> 00:04:18.646
even though there was no
camera around to film it.

00:04:18.646 --> 00:04:21.130
Overall this was a great experience.

00:04:21.130 --> 00:04:23.540
I had awkward moments, funny moments,

00:04:23.540 --> 00:04:25.416
even some failure moments.

00:04:25.416 --> 00:04:26.568
I recommend this experience.

00:04:26.568 --> 00:04:28.749
I want you guys to try it out too,

00:04:28.749 --> 00:04:31.120
get out of your bubble,
tell me how it goes

00:04:31.120 --> 00:04:32.273
in the comments below.

00:04:33.560 --> 00:04:37.093
That went really well, I am
stress sweating really bad.

